WEBVTT

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:43.310
<i>Who... are you?</i>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.030
A dream?

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:27.240
<i>I don't know anything yet.</i>

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:31.250
<i>Not about the precious 
encounters that lie ahead...</i>

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:36.030
<i>nor the cold, cruel truth that 
could rock the entire world.</i>

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:47.830
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:47.830
~The Red Queen Hypothesis~

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:54.270
<i>In this world, there exist 
unique powers known as "Evol,"</i>

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.510
<i>which are possessed by a very few.</i>

00:01:56.830 --> 00:02:00.920
<i>Among them, some chose to fight 
their fate, to fight the world.</i>

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.470
<i>This is the story of these young "Evolvers."</i>

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:23.970
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:27.970
"The Beginning Bonds"

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.510
You made it all up yourself?!

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:31.960
That makes it sound so terrible.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:35.630
To put it more simply, I sort of played 
both director and producer, is all.

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:37.510
Th-Then that includes this photo, too?!

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:39.790
"Hiding deep under the city, 
a new species of reptile!

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.650
Could it be newly evolved?"

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.490
It's true there was something in the pipes.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:47.180
But I just couldn't get a shot, so...

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:49.710
I put some makeup on my pet iguana.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:52.120
I slapped a whole bunch on 
and snapped a picture!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.690
If you're going to use "a whole bunch," 
keep it to your own face.

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:55.830
What was that?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.560
All right, strike everything!

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:58.800
Got it!

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.340
And you're done, too.

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.120
What are we going to do, President?!

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:06.220
Our programming will fall behind schedule!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.500
Give me a second. I'm thinking. 
I'm trying to think of something...

00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:13.380
I told you we shouldn't go 
with a U-Tuber like her!

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:17.000
All she cares about is getting more views!

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.980
You were the one who said a U-Tuber's 
material would be more diverse, Kiki-chan!

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:23.380
All right, all right. 
No looking back, no dragging things out.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.280
Broadcast waits for no one.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.280
I'll take care of things here, but...

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.040
What will you do?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.710
Miracle Finder

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:36.050
<i>A TV show that tells 
stories of miracles and truth,</i>

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.630
Miracle Finder

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:37.630
<i></i>Miracle Finder<i>.</i>

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.800
<i>When my father suddenly died 
two years ago, he left it to me...</i>

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:41.960
<i>his final show.</i>

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.890
<i>At the time, I was a university student.</i>

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:46.490
<i>I took over Miracle Entertainment,</i>

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:49.910
<i>the small production company 
my father had built,</i>

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:51.990
<i>and somehow, we've made it this far, but...</i>

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:56.700
And the Loveland Financial Group is 
the only sponsor we have left, too.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:59.610
If they cut us off, that would
 spell the end for us.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.870
I'll look into that story again.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.740
You mean the mysterious warping incidents?

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:08.500
If I can find new information, 
it will be big news.

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:12.560
Actually, I've found someone who 
might be willing to be a consultant.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:14.500
We agreed to meet this afternoon.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:18.130
Loveland University

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:18.130
Lucien

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:18.130
A guest lecturer at Loveland University?

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:20.160
When did you do this?

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.880
If this doesn't work out, I'll give up.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.340
Anna-san, please let me go.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.310
Just today, all right?

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.290
Thank you!

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:31.280
Kiki-chan, you move forward 
on the Miracle Ice coverage.

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:33.870
Hey! President!

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.090
Is this really okay, Anna-san?

00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:40.560
Once she makes up her mind, 
she never backs down.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:43.370
She gets it from her father.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:48.890
Kiro!

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.430
His new song's out!

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:52.800
He really is so cool...

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:57.150
Couldn't we call in a top talent 
like Kiro to boost our ratings?

00:05:57.150 --> 00:06:00.560
He'd never accept an offer 
from a tiny company like ours.

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:04.720
<i>A few months ago, rumors began 
spreading on the internet</i>

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:06.300
<i>of mysterious warping incidents.</i>

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:08.470
<i>The times and locations of
 the incidents have varied.</i>

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.200
<i>Perhaps time and space have twisted,</i>

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.130
<i>or those lost simply have
no sense of direction...</i>

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:15.480
<i>There are many different theories.</i>

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.970
<i>Two years ago, my father was investigating 
a case right up until his death,</i>

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:25.440
Disappearances occurring in places other than the first 
North: 2 more incidents 
South: 3 incidents
East: none 
West: 4 incidents 
The time of each incident is varied. 
Can't see any method of transport or regularity
 Victim statements 
I would like to conduct interviews, 
but the police have blocked all information.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:26.480
<i>though it seems he never 
managed to arrive at the truth.</i>

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:27.440
Papa...

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:32.180
I suppose the truth wasn't 
going to just drop in my lap.

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:00.890
Kiro—

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:04.480
Sorry. It'd cause a panic.

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:12.870
You like these potato chips?

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:17.330
That's what you're asking?

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.170
This is what I wanted.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:24.820
A card?

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:26.610
Here.

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:32.180
Yes! Bad Hero!

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:33.920
You like him?

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.770
He teaches me about the heart.

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:37.280
"Do not fear loneliness!"

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.990
"As long as justice lives in
 one's heart, that is enough!"

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:42.720
What is it?

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:46.200
Well, videos of you are playing 
all around town, right?

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.450
Just thinking you're a little
 different from your image.

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.890
You're trying to say 
I'm like a little kid, right?

00:07:51.890 --> 00:07:54.080
A kid wouldn't let you 
have the potato chips.

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:55.410
Did you want some?

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.130
My manager would get mad at me.

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:00.120
I gain weight easily.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:02.760
But... In that case, I'll keep it a secret.

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:04.020
Just one chip.

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:06.410
Thanks!

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:08.300
Do you like chips, too?

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:11.060
Yeah. I might like these the best.

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.210
Got it. I'll remember that.

00:08:13.650 --> 00:08:17.010
Next time, I'll share some of 
my favorite snacks with you.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:19.660
Well, I'd better get back.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:20.810
Oh, wait!

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:25.690
I'm actually a producer,

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.550
and we have a show called <i>Miracle Finder</i>...

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:29.720
I know that one!

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.130
I love it!

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:31.860
Really?

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:36.680
Lately, I, um... I've been 
pretty busy, so I haven't...

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.560
I hear that a lot.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:39.880
I'm really sorry.

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:41.120
I see...

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:44.870
If I were on <i>Miracle Finder</i>, 
what would I have to do?

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:46.440
Well, let's see...

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:51.040
Your fans say it seems like you have 
a superpower that entrances people.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:55.570
So if we looked into where that power 
to pull people to you comes from...

00:08:57.630 --> 00:09:00.780
Giving me your business card means 
you were hoping for this, right?

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:02.720
Let me be on your show.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.230
It's thanks for the potato chip.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:09.110
But would a top star like you 
really appear on our show?

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.960
Well...

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:14.420
It's my agency that has the 
final say in what work I do.

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:19.010
They won't let me be on a show 
that can't pull viewership and ratings.

00:09:19.010 --> 00:09:21.410
All right. I'll build up a track record.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:25.560
I'll make it a show that everyone 
will agree is worthy of having you on.

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:27.460
I'll be waiting.

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:33.940
<i>It's like it can't be true! Like a dream!</i>

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.200
<i>No! It's truly a miracle!</i>

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.160
<i>But the real work begins now.</i>

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:43.380
<i>I will take this dreamlike miracle 
and turn it into reality!</i>

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:50.610
<i>My appointment with Professor Lucien 
of Loveland University is at 2:00.</i>

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.730
<i>I'll have lunch somewhere, and...</i>

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.690
<i>I need to get in touch with Anna-san, too.</i>

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:30.810
Evolver?

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:33.360
"Evolver"?

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:35.460
If you don't know, that's fine.

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:36.490
Forget you heard it.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.020
Be careful.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.470
There's no guarantee 
someone will always save you.

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:49.290
Who are you?

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:05.790
Evolver...

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:21.990
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.980
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:29.960
Loveland University

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:58.650
<i>This is Professor Lucien's research lab.</i>

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:01.780
<i>A world-class force in cognitive psychology...</i>

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:04.700
<i>A super-elite figure hailing from
a foreign-owned company...</i>

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:08.500
<i>I mobilized all my nonexistent connections 
to get all the way to a face-to-face.</i>

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.200
<i>I </i>will<i> make this work for the show!</i>

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:16.710
Did you need something?

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:18.220
I, um...

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:20.750
I'd like to meet with Professor Lucien.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:23.840
I'm a producer from Miracle Entertainment.

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:26.440
I'm here from a show called <i>Miracle Finder</i>.

00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:28.320
I've watched it.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.950
There do seem to be some issues 
with the choice of themes.

00:12:31.950 --> 00:12:34.320
It simply inflames popular opinions

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:37.550
and almost never takes a scientific approach.

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:39.860
Thank you for your valuable opinion.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.060
Is Professor Lucien...

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:44.040
Hello, Professor Lucien.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:45.220
Hello.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.950
Shall we speak inside?

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:58.460
<i>No one would believe someone this young 
could be a world-class university professor!</i>

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.710
I understand the gist.

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:06.050
Before they realize it, they've moved 
to a completely different point in town.

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.130
Physics is outside my field of expertise,

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:11.050
but I have read papers on a similar topic.

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:13.270
I can give you several hypotheses.

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:14.600
Really?

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:22.320
<i>The lecture Professor Lucien 
gave me was incredible.</i>

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:24.630
<i>Easy to understand and not too rigid...</i>

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:28.160
<i>Just by listening, I felt 
like I'd gotten smarter.</i>

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.210
I believe that's all.

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.330
Was that of any help?

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:34.350
Yes!

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:36.820
With this, I'll be able to 
make an amazing show!

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:39.760
If someone like you were 
to participate every time,

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:42.040
I think <i>Miracle Finder</i> would 
regain its popularity.

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:42.960
I'd be happy to.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.800
What? Really?

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:48.150
I find it interesting, as well.

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:52.930
The influence that television has 
on people is significant, after all.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:56.980
However, I would like you 
to show me your color.

00:13:57.990 --> 00:14:00.330
My color?

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.280
This plan, and the recent broadcasts,

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:05.570
don't give me a sense of 
your distinctive color.

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:09.880
You're chasing the color of the 
popular <i>Miracle Finder</i> of the past.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:14.840
I'm certain you have a special 
color that is yours and yours alone.

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:16.310
I understand.

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:20.700
I'll contact you when our 
shooting date is confirmed.

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:23.610
Thank you so much for today.

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:26.130
No, thank <i>you</i>. It was fun.

00:14:28.210 --> 00:14:30.760
May I ask one last question?

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.350
Yes. Ask me anything.

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:35.860
Have you ever heard of an "Evolver"?

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.720
Where did you hear that?

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.010
Oh, well...

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:43.830
I overheard it somewhere 
while gathering information...

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:46.030
I, um...

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:51.020
Among scholars in the life sciences,

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:52.780
there's a rumor going around.

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:56.840
While pursuing the potential 
of human evolution,

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:59.810
scholars researching genetics 
in a particular country

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.710
made a certain discovery.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:05.200
The term "Evolver" refers 
to super-evolved humans.

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:10.390
They possess vastly evolved 
genetics and unique abilities.

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:14.140
Put in simple terms, they have
 supernatural powers.

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:16.810
Superpowers...

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:19.250
It's said that many Evolvers in that country

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.930
have been sacrificed for the sake of research.

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:22.750
What?!

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:24.040
It's just a rumor.

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:26.890
Are you interested in superpowers?

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:30.240
I grew up watching my father's shows.

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:33.460
Things that science alone can't explain,

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:35.710
unexplainable miracles...

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:37.170
I feel like they do exist.

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:43.880
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.930
Is that from <i>Through the Looking-Glass</i>?

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:48.770
It's the "Red Queen hypothesis,"

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:50.880
an evolutionary theory.

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.570
Having conquered the natural world,

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:56.170
humanity is beginning to
 forget the threat it poses.

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:59.840
However, that which loses 
the ability to evolve

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:03.900
has no option but extinction when
 faced with a changing environment.

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:07.040
If superpowers do exist,

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:11.650
they may be humanity's last 
great struggle for survival.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.030
Trust your instincts.

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:21.710
It is the only way to survive in this world.

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:32.970
Trust my instincts...

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:39.930
Disappearances occurring in places other than the first 
North: 2 more incidents 
South: 3 incidents
East: none 
West: 4 incidents 
The time of each incident is varied. 
Can't see any method of transport or regularity
 Victim statements 
I would like to conduct interviews, 
but the police have blocked all information.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:36.150
<i>Unsolved cases and my father's accident...</i>

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.460
<i>No matter how much 
I investigate, I find nothing.</i>

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:40.600
<i>The police have closed their investigation.</i>

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:44.940
<i>I've tried to think only of protecting 
the company and the program.</i>

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:48.310
<i>The term "Evolver" refers 
to super-evolved humans.</i>

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:53.360
<i>They possess vastly evolved 
genetics and unique abilities.</i>

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:57.590
<i>Mysterious warping incidents...
The incidents Papa was investigating...</i>

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.990
<i>What if Evolvers are involved somehow?</i>

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:03.780
<i>I'm certain you have a special 
color that is yours and yours alone.</i>

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:07.200
Um, excuse me!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:11.070
I saw you doing interviews in town earlier.

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:13.870
Are you someone from TV?

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:16.160
Huh? Yes...

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:19.550
I'm making a TV show called <i>Miracle Finder</i>—

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:20.490
I know that one!

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:22.990
When I lived at home, 
I watched it every time it was on!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:26.670
Please! Won't you listen to my story?

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:28.610
If you're from TV, I just know—

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:29.910
Huh?

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.320
That's far enough.

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:44.360
You've caused us a lot of trouble.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:00.220
Wait!

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:08.810
This is B7.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:11.480
Contact between target and BS confirmed.

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:12.950
Continuing surveillance.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:18.980
Huh?

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.060
What's going on?

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:22.990
Is this...

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:25.410
Then... that boy...

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:30.970
Anna-san?

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:32.880
This is crazy! I met him!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:35.250
I found the truth behind 
the warping incidents!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.130
It's an Evolver who—

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.640
<i>This isn't the time for that!</i>

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:41.340
<i>LFG is suddenly saying they're 
pulling out all their funding!</i>

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.520
Why?

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:45.960
Wait... If they do that, we'll...

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:47.810
<i>I have no idea what's going on.</i>

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.860
<i>It's all too one-sided!</i>

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:54.700
<i>The Loveland Financial Group.</i>

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:58.740
<i>The capabilities of its CEO, Victor, 
who built it into a massive corporation</i>

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.010
<i>in the mere eight years since its founding,</i>

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:03.710
<i>are said to be legendary 
within the business world.</i>

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:07.620
<i>They are the only investor
 in our small company.</i>

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:11.310
All the funding has been withdrawn 
with no explanation!

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:14.000
I'm begging you! Please connect me 
with the person in charge of this!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.060
With regard to investments,

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:19.550
our CEO makes the final 
decisions on everything.

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:21.410
Then please let me meet with him!

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:24.770
The CEO has decided to make an urgent visit.

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:27.170
All employees, you have 
one minute to prepare!

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:28.570
Please take your leave now.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:31.060
Then I'll ask him about 
the investment in person.

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:35.070
Do you have a death wish?

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:35.970
Huh?

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.630
It was <i>you</i>?!

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:01.790
I want the analysis of this month's
 investments delivered to me in ten minutes.

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:02.440
Yes, sir.

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:04.390
I'm here on behalf of Miracle Entertainment.

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:07.620
I have to talk to the CEO about 
the withdrawal of our funding.

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:09.130
Who are you?

00:20:09.130 --> 00:20:09.930
Hey!

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:12.940
Please, tell me why! I will not accept this!

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.190
Regardless of how small the company may be,

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.110
to think someone who doesn't know 
how to make an appointment

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.820
would be their representative...

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.840
My apologies.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:28.730
That is not why I withdrew 
your funding, however.

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:32.540
No idiot would invest in 
something with no future.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.490
There is no newness to your programming.

00:20:37.220 --> 00:20:39.760
You merely cling religiously to 
your predecessor's methods

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.700
while rotting away like trash.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.470
What expectations could I have of you?

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.000
<i>Papa!</i>

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:01.930
<i>One day, I'm going to 
make TV like you do, Papa!</i>

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:03.410
<i>I see.</i>

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:06.770
<i>In that case, I'm going to have to 
work hard so you don't show me up!</i>

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:13.290
I'll make you regret this, Victor!

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:20.020
In five years, I will stand 
at the top of this industry!

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:23.300
If you come crying to me then, 
it'll be too late! Understand?!

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:46.000
Try and make me... if you can.

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:24.000
<i>Just when I was trying to move forward,</i>

00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:25.860
<i>he appeared...</i>

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:28.090
<i>If you want to know more 
about the incidents,</i>

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:29.620
<i>come with me.</i>

00:23:30.150 --> 00:23:31.480
<i>Episode two,</i>

00:23:31.480 --> 00:23:33.010
<i>"When the Wind Blows."</i>

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:34.970
"When the Wind Blows"
